  "short_description": "從一間小小店鋪開始，邀請好友合作，靈活運用輸送帶、輸送管與魔法裝置打造自動化產線，將藥劑、珠寶與聖物送上貨架，完成委託、累積財富，打造專屬於你的中世紀煉金工廠，成為富甲一方的煉金大亨！《煉金工廠》1.0 正式版現已推出，快來體驗貨車系統與全面升級的店鋪經營玩法吧！",
  "short_description_en": "Start small, team up with friends, and automate production with conveyor belts, pipes, and magical devices. Stock your shop with potions, jewelry, and relics, complete commissions, and build an alchemy empire! Alchemy Factory 1.0 is out now with the Wagon Logistics System and revamped shopkeeping.",
